  tierReadouts:
  - TierLabel: LV1 Laser Tap
    StageRole: Low-return ranged helper that sets up cleanly but cannot block pressure.
    PlayerUse: Spend when the boss lane is open and a cheap ranged body is enough.
    SummonRead: SciFi rifleman slides into a side lane, flashes a cyan muzzle beam,
      and fires one clean laser line per volley.
  - TierLabel: LV2 Split Laser
    StageRole: Mid-tier ranged support with two visible lines and controlled sustained
      pressure.
    PlayerUse: Hold EN if the boss will stay exposed for more than one volley.
    SummonRead: Laser soldier fires one sharper cyan line with a larger beam flash
      while staying fragile.
  - TierLabel: LV3 Prism Burst
    StageRole: High-tier glass-cannon support that widens the lane punish without
      becoming a turret.
    PlayerUse: Use when the player has created a long punish window and does not
      need a blocker.
    SummonRead: Wider two-line laser burst and stronger muzzle beam, but a slower
      cadence and low body safety.
